<view class="page booking safe-bottom"><view class="eyebrow">东方发艺 · 到店之约</view><view class="page-title title">预约到店</view><view class="intro">三家门店均可预约 · 全周 12:00—24:00</view>
<view class="block"><view class="block-title"><text>01</text>选择门店</view><scroll-view scroll-x class="store-scroll"><view class="store-row"><view wx:for="{{stores}}" wx:key="id" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="chooseStore" class="store-option {{storeIndex===index?'active':''}}"><text class="b">{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.address}}</text></view></view></scroll-view></view>
<view class="block"><view class="block-title"><text>02</text>选择项目</view><view wx:for="{{services}}" wx:key="id" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="chooseService" class="service-option {{serviceIndex===index?'active':''}}"><image wx:if="{{item.image}}" class="service-photo" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view><text class="b">{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.time}}</text></view><text class="strong">¥{{item.price}}起</text></view></view>
<view class="block"><view class="block-title"><text>03</text>选择到店时间</view><view class="tip">周一至周日 · 每2小时一档</view><scroll-view scroll-x><view class="day-row"><view wx:for="{{days}}" wx:key="value" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="chooseDay" class="day {{dayIndex===index?'active':''}}"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text class="b">{{item.date}}</text></view></view></scroll-view><view class="time-grid"><view wx:for="{{times}}" wx:key="*this" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="chooseTime" class="time {{timeIndex===index?'active':''}}">{{item}}</view></view></view>
<button class="service-help" open-type="contact">不确定怎么选？联系微信客服</button><view class="summary"><view><text>预约项目</text><text class="b">{{services[serviceIndex].name}}</text><text class="strong">¥{{services[serviceIndex].price}} 起</text></view><button bindtap="submit">确认预约</button></view></view>

